---
import ProseLayout from '../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<ProseLayout
  title="About ShopOwnerStack"
  h1="About us"
  kicker="About"
  type="AboutPage"
  path="/about/"
  updated={new Date('2026-09-26')}
  description="ShopOwnerStack publishes independent, research-based reviews of the software small service businesses run on, written for owners who have no time to read twelve vendor websites."
>
  <h2>What is ShopOwnerStack?</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is an independent review site for the software local service businesses run on:
    field service and job management, salon and spa booking, fitness studio management and auto
    repair shop systems. We write for the owner of a two-van plumbing firm or a four-chair salon,
    not for enterprise IT buyers.
  </p>

  <h2>How are the reviews made?</h2>
  <p>
    Our reviews are <strong>research-based</strong>. For each product we read the vendor's public
    pricing pages, plan comparisons and help-centre documentation, and we study patterns across
    hundreds of public user reviews on sites such as G2, Capterra and Software Advice. We then rate
    each product against the same published rubric. Every review lists the sources it relies on and
    the date prices were last checked.
  </p>
  <p>
    We say this plainly because many review sites imply hands-on testing they never did. Where we
    have not used a feature ourselves, we do not pretend to have. The full method is on
    <a href="/how-we-test/">how we review</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>How does the site make money?</h2>
  <p>
    Some links to software vendors are partner (affiliate) links: if you sign up through one, the
    vendor may pay us a commission at no extra cost to you. We may also show clearly labelled
    display advertising. Neither affects ratings or rankings, and products without a partner
    programme are reviewed and ranked exactly the same way. Details are in our
    <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Who writes the reviews?</h2>
  <p>
    Reviews are written and maintained by the {SITE.name} editorial team. We update pages when
    vendors change plans or prices and show the last updated date at the top of every page.
  </p>

  <h2>Spotted a mistake?</h2>
  <p>
    Software changes fast. If a price, plan or feature on this site is out of date, please
    <a href="/contact/">tell us</a>. Corrections are made promptly and the updated date is changed
    when we do.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
